Goldman Sachs Asset Management and T. Rowe Price have launched four co-branded model portfolios aimed at advisors serving mass affluent and high-net-worth investors.&nbsp;

The models are the first in a larger anticipated rollout of joint products after the two asset managers announced a strategic alliance in September. They are available through the GeoWealth UMA platform.&nbsp;

